# ...except the hand-digitised published curves under data/. They are source, not
# output: they cannot be regenerated without re-reading the figures by eye, the test
# suite loads them, and the blanket rule above meant a clone had neither the files nor
# any sign they were missing until eight tests errored.
!data/*.csv

